Error [E0212]: `source` cannot be assigned while `selected` is still looking into it
  --> zero_copy_parser_blocks_source_replacement_while_token_is_live.jet:28:5
    |
 28 |     source = "other:data"
    |     ^^^^^^
 Why: `selected` is a live read view into `source`; changing or moving the owner could invalidate that view
 Fix: Finish using `selected` before changing `source`, narrow the view's scope, or make an owned copy
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0212
